{
  "rationale": "Use a small plant split into sensing and motion capability, then encode the exploration and obstacle-recovery policy in compact deterministic specifications. The policy gives strong forward bias in clear space, uses short directed turns for side/front obstacles, allows rare brief backward escape only after front blockage, and reserves full_rotate for a dedicated repeated-failure last-resort path.",
  "strategy": [
    "Separate uncontrollable perception from controllable motion capability in G",
    "Use one main policy automaton plus small sequencing specs to prevent repeated turning/random actions and to gate last-resort full_rotate after repeated front blockage"
  ],
